Z||000005||My7Fieros||10-05-2000||10:57 PM||||Fieros should idle at 900-950 in drive/neutral, and 700-750 in gear.<BR>Your timing may be off...check to see if your exhaust manifolds glow while at idle..if so, your timing is retarded..<BR>Ogre would be the person to answer this one.||||reg||1
