Z||000024||Bob Englert||10-09-2000||05:33 PM||||1,800 rpm is too high if the car is warmed up.  It should idle below 1,000 rpm in netral or drive (drive will be a little lower).  Check carfully for vac leaks.<BR>||||reg||1
